          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[#5a7c65] mt-1">✓</span>
            <span class="text-[#373e45]/80">Tech stack evaluation and recommendations</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="group relative bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[rgba(55,62,69,0.08)] p-8 shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#8b7d6b] to-[#5a7c65] rounded-t-2xl"></div>
        <div class="mb-6 text-center sm:text-left">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#8b7d6b]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mx-auto sm:mx-0">
            <span class="text-2xl text-[#8b7d6b]">2</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Custom App Development</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[#5a7c65] mt-1">✓</span>
